#: ../../source/postcss-discard-comments_README.md:33
msgid ""
"This module discards comments from your CSS files; by default, it will "
"remove all regular comments (`/* comment */`) and preserve comments "
"marked as important (`/*! important */`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-discard-comments_README.md:37
msgid ""
"Note that this module does not handle source map comments because they "
"are not available to it; PostCSS handles this internally, so if they are "
"removed then you will have to [configure source maps in PostCSS][maps]."
msgstr ""

